{"id":"045506c85f1cfaed","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FmLProof.md","title":"FmLProof","display":"FmLProof","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FmLProof","parameters":["t","z168"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FmLProof"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>t</span><span>z168</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命题语法。有序参数：<code>t</code>、<code>z168</code>。</p>\n<p>有限带标签公式。：非空有限见证列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FmLProof t z168)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z171\n  (exists z172\n    (and\n      (@ Seq z168 z171)\n      (and\n        (@ Last z168 z172)\n        (and\n          (= z172 t)\n          (forall z169\n            (implies (in z169 z171) (exists z170 (and (@ App z168 z169 z170) (@ FmLRow z168 z169 z170))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6d70634cb471ef1\" href=\"?note=d6d70634cb471ef1\" title=\"ZFC_FmLRow\">FmLRow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d72dedf3d7200b4b\" href=\"?note=d72dedf3d7200b4b\" title=\"ZFC_Last\">Last</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" 